### Normalized scores (1–100)

- **Tool use: 62/100.** Evidence TB ~45% ; Tool use weak vs premium; capped by missing Claw-Eval/Tau3 isolation.
- **Reasoning: 62/100.** Evidence GPQA ~65% ; HLE ~20%; capped by incomplete HLE/MRCR.
- **Context window: 94/100.** 1M (Ollama local builds 256K) — tiered per methodology (≥1M=95-100, 200K=70, 256K≈72).
- **Multimodal: 15/100.** Text in/out only; scored per multimodal rubric (text-only 15, image 60-70, video/PDF 75-90, audio-in 90-100).
- **Coding: 64/100.** Evidence SWE ~45% ; LiveCode ~70% local; capped by missing isolated LiveCode/SciCode where noted.
- **Cost efficiency: 70/100.** Paid ~$0.80/$2.40 per 1M ; local Ollama 256K 35GB.
- **Overall Score: 59/100.** Mean of five non-cost dims (62+62+94+15+64)/5=59.4 → 59; best-fit per scoring methodology.

